\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8.7}{\ignorespaces Figure~7 reproduction, real run. Wall time is the match-side entry's own reported \texttt  {micros}; the non-match side is within a few percent throughout and omitted for space. Peak memory is not reported here: this run used \texttt  {bench\_pathological\_time} (crash/timeout plus wall time only) --- a dedicated \texttt  {bench\_pathological\_memory} pass at this same scale is still pending and would be needed for a real peak-bytes figure at 1\,M+ characters; earlier informal estimates for that figure have been removed rather than presented as measured.}}{79}{table.caption.49}\protected@file@percent }
